{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10271170","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10271170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1027117001:0":{"text":"你们——你们就是之前欺负一叶的那些家伙！","source_cn":"你们——你们就是之前欺负一叶的那些家伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA8E5E828F2F56B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027117002:0":{"text":"啧，哪来的小孩，少多管闲事，我们在维持正常治安！","source_cn":"啧，哪来的小孩，少多管闲事，我们在维持正常治安！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x424DEC13C9A50687","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027117003:0":{"text":"荧荧花这种野生生物，只要闯入绿裔居住的区域，都可能会造成危害！必须清除它！","source_cn":"荧荧花这种野生生物，只要闯入绿裔居住的区域，都可能会造...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10C766D09564762A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027117004:0":{"text":"荧荧花和我们一样，都是丛林的原住民。它们只是和我们长得不一样！","source_cn":"荧荧花和我们一样，都是丛林的原住民。它们只是和我们长得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66727E012CE7D1E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027117005:0":{"text":"你说她闯入有人居住的领地，那把她送回野外就好了，干嘛要伤害她？！这片丛林又不只是我们绿裔的家——","source_cn":"你说她闯入有人居住的领地，那把她送回野外就好了，干嘛要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8843AEF923F2AE95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male"